# PHP style

Match Laravel Pint and PHPCS (Slevomat). Do not invent a different style.

- Start PHP files with `declare(strict_types=1);`.
- Keep imports ordered and unused imports removed.
- Before finishing, run `vendor/bin/pint --dirty` on touched PHP, then `vendor/bin/phpcs` on those paths.
- If Pint rewrites a file, keep that formatting. Do not hand-format against it.
